<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Not here... 
{PAUSE ""}
Not here... 
{PAUSE ""}
Not here... 
{PAUSE ""}
Not here...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Dad<STYLE ID="1">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The falsificaso's gone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... What do you need that for?"</STYLE><PG>
"Don't you get it? Someone stole it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... What could they mean to do with it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's strange... It was definitely here until yesterday. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it's been stolen, we're in trouble."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... We weren't planning to use it at next week's rite anyway, were we?"</STYLE><PG>
"That's not what I mean. What if someone's planning to use the falsificaso as a drug?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... That certainly would be trouble. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But the falsificaso doesn't work anymore, does it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's true, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
What on earth do they mean to use it for?"<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
